OL,3,GNEWSATeenage girl raped by man in
OL,4,Abalaclava, police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage girl has been raped by a man
OL,7,Fwearing a balaclava after being pulled
OL,8,Finto bushes, police say.
OL,10,FOfficers were called to Newpool Road in
OL,11,FKnypersley, Staffordshire, shortly
OL,12,Fbefore 08:00 BST on Monday to reports
OL,13,Fof a girl walking in the area being
OL,14,Fattacked by a man who had approached
OL,15,Fher.
OL,17,FShe was then grabbed and pulled into
OL,18,Fbushes, Staffordshire Police said,
OL,19,Fdescribing the man as white, around 6ft
OL,20,F1ins (1.85m) tall and wearing a
OL,21,Fbalaclava, black joggers and a black
OL,22,Fpuffer coat.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
